ot three projects for phase  six and of course we already knew the  Fantastic Four were coming Kevin feige  has confirmed that multiple times they  just confirmed the release date date for  us which was nice but now seeing as how  some surprises might be coming at ccxp  we're looking forward to what the rest  of the phase six slate is at ccxp they  could reveal the entirety of the Slate  or they could reveal some projects that  are going to be coming in phase six just  not the entire thing but now it does  seem like it's time to reveal the rest  we are almost in 2023 which means phase  six is just about two years away so what  movies and projects could realistically  be coming in phase six well like I said  we already know four projects and really  we actually know five projects coming in  phase six we have Deadpool 3 The  Fantastic Four Avengers Secret Wars  Avengers King Dynasty and armor Wars  which is now going to be made into a  movie not a Disney Plus show now we know  arm rewards is going to tie into secret  Invasion and most likely the  Thunderbolts and Captain America new  world order as well after all Roadie was  in the Falcon and the Winter Soldier he  was talking to Sam about becoming the  new Captain America and now Sam is the  new captain in America so I would expect  Roadie to be in that film or at least  mentioned so as of right now we have  five confirmed movies coming in phase  six what other movies and shows could be  coming not to mention special  presentations now of course everybody  wants to know about the X-Men and the  mutants and of course I do too I want  the mutants in the MCU very very badly  however I don't actually think they're  coming until phase seven based off of  everything that we've heard so far it  sounds like Kevin feige has plans to  introduce new X-Men characters and  mutants after Secret Wars but before  then we are still going to get mutants  and we'll still have an X-Men team  however these X-Men are going to be  coming from the fox universe and  apparently this is all going to start  with Deadpool According to some recent  rumors and leaks Deadpool is going to  bring a lot of X-Men into the MCU and  this is kind of going to be Kevin  feige's way of saying goodbye to the  X-Men Kevin feige started with Marvel by  working on the the X-Men and Spider-Man  films he's worked on the original X-Men  Spider-Man with Sam Raimi the Fantastic  Four The Punisher he's worked with  Marvel for a very very long time before  he was the president of Marvel Studios  he started as an associate producer and  worked his way up so Kevin feige worked  on all of these old what we call the fox  Universe films and the Sam Raimi  Spider-Man films what a perfect way for  him to truly say goodbye to this  universe by him putting them in the new  universe plus not to mention many of  these old actors from these old Marvel  movies said that they wish they had a  chance to be in the Marvel Cinematic  Universe well this is their way of being  in the universe then the actors in Kevin  foggy could say goodbye but having said  that I think that means that no new  X-Men and mutant characters are going to  be introduced in a big way and what I  mean by that is obviously we have seen  Namor is a mutant we have seen that  Kamala Khan although not a mutant in the  comics is a mutant in the MCU so yes  marvelous Studios will start talking  about mutants in the MCU before Phase 6  ends however I don't think the true team  is coming until phase seven so  unfortunately in phase six I don't think  there's a mutant project scheduled  however I would love to be wrong however  there are some projects that are  confirmed that we know to be coming in  phase six and I am really really excited  for them the first one of course is  Spider-Man 4. what we know so far about  Spider-Man 4 is that the deal for  Spider-Man to remain in the MCU is  pretty much done if not already done the  New Deal is rumored to be for six movies  three movies that are Solo Spider-Man  films and three team-up films with one  possibly being for an appearance in a  show possibly Daredevil born again that  would make the most sense now there is a  tiny possibility this could get revealed  at ccxp however typically Sony is the  one to reveal anything about Spider-Man  and they have confirmed they are not  attending ccxp this year however we know  it's going to be a part of phase six now  another one that has been confirmed is  Nova now this isn't going to be a movie  it's not going to be a show but a  special presentation is what has been  said recently if you've kept up with the  channel you know that I think special  presentations to introduce new  characters are actually a really good  idea I think it worked extremely well  with werewolf by night so having Nova  introduced into the MCU as a special  presentation I'm all for it now we know  from Avengers Infinity war that Thanos  decimated xandar which means the Nova  force is most likely on its way to Earth  to collide with Richard Ryder this just  makes the most sense continuity wise  plus lining up with the comics as well  so I'm assuming this is somewhat of what  we'll see in the special presentation  now xiangxi 2 has also been confirmed  they confirmed this after the first film  came out and see malio the actor who  plays shangchi has pretty much confirmed  that he's going to be popping up in  other places before Avengers Secret Wars  happens so perhaps they'll show up in  other projects but we can assume since  the second Shang Chi has already been  confirmed that it'll happened before  Avengers Secret Wars especially if you  consider Kang probably has something to  do with the tin rings so they'll have to  explore that before the movie comes out  and I am talking about the artifacts not  the actual tin Rings organization which  will be a show in Disney plus about his  sister running the 10 Rings organization  we also know that a Wonder Man show is  going to be coming this is going to be a  Disney Plus show and based off of what  we've heard this is going to be coming  in phase six and recently variety has  revealed that Marvel has cast Yaya Abdul  Mateen to be Wonder Man himself so since  they've already cast him this is most  likely coming pretty soon it actually  could come in Phase five just because it  seems like they've revealed all of phase  five already doesn't mean that they  can't add other projects in after the  fact but it is pretty cramped so far and  they haven't started filming or anything  like that yet so I'm still thinking it's  coming in phase six now another one is  Doctor Strange three now Doctor Strange  3 is confirmed however it's not  confirmed that the movie will come in  phase six however we are taking an  educated guess here considering the fact  that secret Wars is going to be about  the Multiverse and incursions and the  post-credits scene for Doctor Strange 2  spoiler alert was Clea showing up  telling doctor strange that he caused an  incursion and they needed to go fix it  so clearly Doctor Strange 3 is going to  have a pretty big impact on what the  Multiverse actually is and all of the  incursions happening so it's most likely  safe to assume that this will come out  before Secret Wars so realistically  these are projects that have been  officially confirmed that are most  likely coming in phase six so hopefully  since Marvel Studios has some surprises  in store for us at ccxp we could get  some information about some of these  maybe all of them but I wouldn't expect  too much don't get expectations too high  and I do want to add a little bonus here  a Silver Surfer presentation has been  rumored to be in the works at Marvel  Studios as well this is not confirmed so  we're not going to say that it's going  to be a part of phase six but if it does  end up happening it will most likely end  up in phase six however like I said not  confirmed but let me know your thoughts  about all of these other projects in the  comments down below and let me know your  thoughts on the original X-Men appearing  in the MCU don't forget to like the  video and subscribe stay up to date on  all things relating to the MCU for live  updates you can follow us on Instagram  and Twitter and as always thank you all  so much for watching wolf wolf

